  - benchmark
  - audio processing
  - robustness evaluation
  - carrier conditions
abstract: >-
  The CASE (Carrier-Agnostic Speaker Embedding) Benchmark evaluates speaker
  verification model robustness across real-world acoustic carrier conditions
  including codecs, microphones, noise, reverb, and playback chains. It reveals
  significant performance gaps in state-of-the-art models and demonstrates how
  carrier-aware training can improve robustness.
